<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Elongated Limbs</ansi> mutation

Your arms and fingers stretch beyond their natural proportions. Reach
and deftness improve, but raw power suffers from the altered leverage.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Moderately improved dexterity — the extra reach and lengthened
  fingers grant surprising finesse

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Slightly reduced strength — the altered proportions sacrifice
  leverage and raw striking power

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Extra Arms

